      "file": "research/frontier-44-special-representation-examples-28-owner-step3-cellular-branching-bindings-round1/coherent-round1/after/cor-type-a-hecke-specht-modules-are-in-the-same-block-iff-their-labels-have-the-same-e-core.md",
